      "color": "#91b2e8",
      "height": 162,
      "id": "e5eb88e20ff67579",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n**November 14-24, 1969**\nSecond mission to land humans on the Moon.\n",
