      "x": -136,
      "y": -144
    },
    {
      "color": "#91b2e8",
      "height": 162,
      "id": "13daf003a25c49fa",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n**May 18-26, 1969**\nDress rehearsal for 1st Moon landing. Tested  n  Moon's orbit.\n",
