    },
    {
      "height": 180,
      "id": "a1e1e180ff6db5e5",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---**July 16-24, 1969**\nFirst mission to land humans on the Moon. [Learn more](https://billpetro.com/history-of-1st-moon-landing-apollo-11/)\n",
